{"id":"694fa3b59163804b","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Seq Decreasing Sequence","display":"df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence — ZFC Seq Decreasing Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence — ZFC Seq Decreasing Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence — ZFC Seq Decreasing Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c63f9745812e31bd\" href=\"?note=c63f9745812e31bd\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\leq_A\\in V\">\\(s,\\leq_A\\in V\\)</span> (sequence and comparison relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S\\)</span> (ordinal-domain sequence predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (linear-order predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDecreasingSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDecreasingSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}decreasing\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDecreasingSequence}_S(s,\\leq_A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\in\\omega+1\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S(D,s)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(A,\\leq_A)\\land\\forall i,j\\in D\\;\\bigl(i\\in j\\to\\langle s(j),s(i)\\rangle\\in\\leq_A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}decreasing\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDecreasingSequence}_S(s,\\leq_A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\in\\omega+1\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S(D,s)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(A,\\leq_A)\\land\\forall i,j\\in D\\;\\bigl(i\\in j\\to\\langle s(j),s(i)\\rangle\\in\\leq_A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The domain is an initial ordinal (finite or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> is required to be a function, and its values are typed in the carrier of a genuine linear order.</li>\n<li>The reversal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle s(j),s(i)\\rangle\\in\\leq_A\">\\(\\langle s(j),s(i)\\rangle\\in\\leq_A\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;j\">\\(i&lt;j\\)</span> states that later values lie below earlier ones.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain","status":"resolved","id":"c63f9745812e31bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,\\leq_A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDecreasingSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}decreasing\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDecreasingSequence}_S(s,\\leq_A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\in\\omega+1\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S(D,s)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(A,\\leq_A)\\land\\forall i,j\\in D\\;\\bigl(i\\in j\\to\\langle s(j),s(i)\\rangle\\in\\leq_A\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle s(j),s(i)\\rangle\\in\\leq_A","display":false},{"tex":"i<j","display":false}],"bytes":1365,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3344","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-seq-decreasing-sequence]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["c63f9745812e31bd","b40aa6d4a7d8288a"]}